# Every text file is stored with LF, whatever the uploader's OS or git config.
# (v1.3.0 was pushed from Windows with core.autocrlf=true and landed with CRLF: "bash\r" broke the scripts.)
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff2 binary
